        "DefaultText": "Death Cap Ward"
    },
    "CardDescription": {
        "ParentObjectID": "herbs_fungi_death_cap_ward",
        "LocalizationKey": "Herbs_And_Fungi_DeathCapWard_CardDescription",
        "DefaultText": "A grim totem of stakes strung with death cap mushrooms. Set it in the ground and the reek of the toxins keeps wild animals warier of the place where it stands."
    },
    "CardHelpSection": {
        "ParentObjectID": "herbs_fungi_death_cap_ward",
        "LocalizationKey": "Herbs_And_Fungi_DeathCapWard_CardHelpSection",
        "DefaultText": "<b>Use:</b> Place it at your camp or any location you want to defend.\n\n<b>Effect:</b> While a placed ward is where you are, a bear, wolf, wolf pack, primeval wolf or boar that attacks you is turned away 25 percent of the time, and so is any other wild-animal encounter that starts without a creature on the map. People are never turned away, and neither is a fight you start yourself.\n\n<b>Decay:</b> The mushrooms rot in about ten days, placed or carried."
    },
